            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.82</h2><ul><li>Fixes the in-app updater path by launching the local bridge from an absolute runtime entry point while keeping LaunchAgent working files outside the signed app bundle.</li><li>Keeps runtime logs and temporary working state in user-owned storage so Sparkle can validate and replace the app cleanly.</li></ul>
]]></description>
