            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.81</h2><ul><li>Fixes update validation by moving runtime transcript logs out of the signed app bundle.</li><li>Adds a LaunchAgent-level runtime log directory guard so future bridge starts keep logs in Application Support.</li><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice interruption handling so a new spoken turn replaces the active streamed turn instead of being dropped as busy.</li></ul>
]]></description>
